1
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,560
I'm leaving home.

2
00:00:18,370 --> 00:00:20,360
We're on our way to the station.

3
00:00:20,990 --> 00:00:22,440
I'm so excited!

4
00:00:26,820 --> 00:00:32,360
We're standing on the platform waiting for the train to Delamere Forest.

5
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:37,940
We're here!

6
00:00:38,880 --> 00:00:48,715
What a fantastic place to see my favourite singer Jess Glynne right in the middle of a beautiful forest.

7
00:00:53,160 --> 00:00:55,391
I'm eating a hot dog.

8
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,880
It's very expensive, but it's not very good!

9
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:07,082
It's getting dark now.

10
00:01:07,380 --> 00:01:09,960
The stage is completely black.

11
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:15,140
A few people are talking, but most people are quiet.

12
00:01:15,980 --> 00:01:17,580
We're waiting for Jess.

13
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:20,020
And here she comes!

14
00:01:20,700 --> 00:01:22,120
Everyone is cheering!

15
00:01:22,820 --> 00:01:24,040
What a noise!

16
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,500
Jess isn't on stage.

17
00:01:32,440 --> 00:01:34,180
Is the show over?

18
00:01:34,980 --> 00:01:36,360
No way!

19
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:39,340
We're all shouting 'more'.

20
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,560
Why are we shouting?

21
00:01:42,240 --> 00:01:44,600
Because we want MORE!

22
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,568
But don't worry.

23
00:01:46,920 --> 00:01:49,761
She's walking back onto the stage.

24
00:01:54,540 --> 00:01:56,760
We're on the train home.

25
00:01:57,510 --> 00:01:59,280
We aren't sitting down.

26
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:01,120
I don't care.

27
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:08,100
There are so many people on the train and everybody's a Jess Glynne fan.

28
00:02:08,710 --> 00:02:11,564
We're all singing 'Hold my Hand'.

29
00:02:12,130 --> 00:02:14,142
It's my favourite song.

30
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:21,990
It's exactly midnight and we're back home.

31
00:02:22,710 --> 00:02:25,720
I'm feeling tired but very happy.

32
00:02:26,570 --> 00:02:29,200
I'm going straight upstairs to bed.

